<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Westfield half year net profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Westfield half year net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit	     53.66 vs  46.35</p>
<p>    Net				40.93 vs  35.10</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)	     20.9  vs  17.9</p>
<p>NOTE: Westfield Holdings Ltd is a shopping centre operator.</p>
</text>
